/* ============================================================================
 * VEYRA console (React + Vite). Single-file UI: nav → section views → modals.
 *
 * Help — structure and data dependencies (read before editing):
 * - `API`: backend base URL (`VITE_API_URL` or localhost:8000). `load()` polls
 *   18 endpoints every 15s into section state (overview, findings, ports, flows,
 *   assets, incidents, identities, sessions, intel, cloud, aiAssets, graph,
 *   paths, tools, ftools, devices, dnsTop, logins, loginSum).
 * - `SEV_HELP` + `RISK_FORMULA`: severity explainer text — MUST match the bands
 *   in `backend/app/services/risk.py:severity` and `SEVERITY_PLAYBOOKS` in
 *   `backend/app/services/teams.py` (all three use ≥80/≥60/≥35).
 * - `why*()` helpers: per-row "why flagged" rationale (finding/identity/cloud/
 *   port/flow/session). Shown inline + inside `DetailModal`.
 * - Views: Overview (clickable KPI `Card`s → `DrillModal`), GraphView,
 *   NetworkView, Ops, IdentityView (+brute-force), CloudView, AIView,
 *   OffensiveView (safe web assessment), ForensicsView (static upload),
 *   EndpointView (devices+DNS), DataView, GovView, RedTeamView, BlueTeamView
 *   (severity playbooks + live triage), Placeholder.
 * - `DrillModal`: overview-tile drill-down. `DetailModal`: generic row summary
 *   for kinds finding|incident|port|flow|identity|session|cloud|ai|intel|
 *   asset|path|device|dns|login. Panel `VIEW ALL →` jumps sections via `go()`.
 * ========================================================================== */
